  "description": "Application for a Non-Material Amendment to Planning Permission ref: 20/02499/OUT (Outline planning application for the demolition of Lever House and the erection of a Residential (C3) building not exceeding 16 storeys comprising of a maximum of 115 units, along with a ground floor cafe/retail pod (Use Class - E (c)) with all matters reserved except for access, layout and scale.\rThis application is accompanied by an Environmental Statement.\rThis application is Phase 2 of a 2 stage development - Phase 1 is covered by application reference 20/02495/FUL.\rAdditional Reconsultation Information: Provision of 20 Social rented units (17.4%) and 16 shared ownership units (13.9%) representing 35.2% of the residential units by habitable room; Public footpath to north of Hogsmill realigned, provision of additional childrens play space. Other matters contained within the planning application have not changed.). \rAmendment to the wording of Condition 3 to alter the trigger point as to when the Design Code is required to be submitted.\r",
